=== WEAPON Crash_Axe Bronze
Sharpened axe
You can chase rats with this axe.

=== WEAPON Crash_Crossbow Bronze
Old crossbow
Pierces leather armor from a hundred paces away.

=== WEAPON Crash_Short_Bow Bronze
Wrong bow
It's already better value for money.

=== WEAPON Crash_Spear Bronze
Light spade
Not the worst weapon for a novice.

=== WEAPON Crash_Sword Bronze
Broken sword
A good sword, if not for the fact that it is broken and hastily forged.

