=== WEAPON Crystal_Axe Diamond
Diamond axe
The best possible axe.

=== WEAPON Crystal_Bow Diamond
Diamond bow
A masterpiece from ancient times.

=== WEAPON Crystal_Crossbow Diamond
Diamond crossbow
This does not come cheap: but a bolt shot from this crossbow will pierce any kind of armor.

=== WEAPON Crystal_Mace Diamond
Diamond mace
Even meteorite armor will not resist its blows!

=== WEAPON Crystal_Short_Bow Diamond
Diamond short bow
At least as valuable as royal jewels!

