=== WEAPON Komposite_Bow Adamantium
Adamantite composite bow
Very little resists this bow.

=== WEAPON Komposite_Bow Bronze
Bronze composite bow
Heavy and unwieldy, but can cause some damage.

=== WEAPON Komposite_Bow Iron
Iron composite bow
Better than a longbow, but that's about it.

=== WEAPON Komposite_Bow Meteoric
Meteorite composite bow
This extremely powerful bow is even capable of penetrates plate armor.

=== WEAPON Komposite_Bow Mithrill
Mithrill composite bow
Strong and powerful, but there are better bows out there!

=== WEAPON Komposite_Bow Steel
Steel composite bow
This type of bow is not actually made for steel, but anything is possible.

