=== WEAPON Stone_Axe Corundum
Corundum axe
You might even cut yourself with this axe!

=== WEAPON Stone_Axe Jade
Jade axe
Not very sharp, but it can cast spells!

=== WEAPON Stone_Axe Malachite
Obsidian axe 
Only stone axes made from corundum are better than this.

=== WEAPON Stone_Battle_Axe Corundum
Corundum battle axe
This axe will make your opponent respect you.

=== WEAPON Stone_Battle_Axe Jade
Jade battle axe
Looks good, hits hard.

=== WEAPON Stone_Battle_Axe Malachite
Obsidian battle axe
Only stone battle axes made from corundum are better than this.

=== WEAPON Stone_Battle_Sword Corundum
Corundum battle sword
The best sword on Gipath.

=== WEAPON Stone_Battle_Sword Granite
Granite battle sword
With this weapon you can successfully fight goblins.
=== WEAPON Stone_Battle_Sword Jade
Jade battle sword
Great potential if you infuse it with magic!

=== WEAPON Stone_Battle_Sword Malachite
Obsidian battle sword
One of the best.

=== WEAPON Stone_Battle_Sword Rock
Stone battle sword
This weapon is quite good, but the material chosen for it is unfortunate.

=== WEAPON Stone_Battle_Sword Silicon
Silicon battle sword
Not a bad weapon, well worth the price.

=== WEAPON Stone_Battle_hammer Corundum
Heavy corundum hammer
This is a heavy one! Only metal hammers are better.

=== WEAPON Stone_Battle_hammer Jade
Heavy jade hammer
Try calling lightning with it.

=== WEAPON Stone_Battle_hammer Malachite
Heavy obsidian hammer 
Only heavy stone hammers made from corundum are better than this.

=== WEAPON Stone_Dagger Corundum
Corundum dagger
A good piercing dagger - the best of stone daggers.

=== WEAPON Stone_Dagger Jade
Jade dagger
You should make jewelry with such material instead...

=== WEAPON Stone_Dagger Malachite
Obsidian dagger
Only stone daggers made from corundum are better than this.

=== WEAPON Stone_Hammer Corundum
Corundum hammer
Sufficient to break a Goblin's head with the first blow!

=== WEAPON Stone_Hammer Jade
Jade hammer
An expensive hammer.

=== WEAPON Stone_Hammer Malachite
Obsidian hammer
Only stone hammers made of corundum are better than this.


=== WEAPON Stone_Short_Bow Corundum
Bow (corundum head arrows)
Causes the maximum damage possible with this kind of weapon.

=== WEAPON Stone_Short_Bow Jade
Bow (jade head arrows)
Make each arrow count!

=== WEAPON Stone_Short_Bow Malachite
Bow (obsidian head arrows)
One of the best of its kind.

=== WEAPON Stone_Spear Corundum
Corundum head spear
Now this does look like a real spear...

=== WEAPON Stone_Spear Jade
Jade head spear
Beautiful spear!

=== WEAPON Stone_Spear Malachite
Obsidian head spear
Only stone spears made from corundum are better than this.


=== WEAPON Stone_Sword Corundum
Corundum sword
Only metal swords are better than those made of corundum.

=== WEAPON Stone_Sword Jade
Jade sword
Sharp, expensive, powerful.

=== WEAPON Stone_Sword Malachite
Obsidian sword
Only stone swords made from corundum are better than this.

=== WEAPON Thief_Crossbow Bronze
Thieving Crossbow
With a crossbow like this, you can kill a troll by hitting it in the forehead!

=== WEAPON Thief_Dagger Bronze
Thief's dagger
If money is no object, you won't find a better knife.
=== WEAPON Thief_Short_Bow Bronze
Thief's bow
Thief bows are used by the most experienced hunters.

=== WEAPON Thief_Spear Bronze
Thieves' Spike
Although its damage is low, it can be used for support.

=== WEAPON Thief_Sword Bronze
Thieving sword
With such a sword, you can prove to a young ogre that sometimes food is wormy.

